Subject: ARM: dts: hisilicon: build the AR513W board DTB


The Hi3716CV200 board file has no build target.
The part has its own machine symbol now, so its DTB is gated on that
rather than on ARCH_MULTIPLATFORM.
Add the target.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)


diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/hisilicon/Makefile b/arch/arm/boot/dts/hisilicon/Makefile
index c3641d9265f6..dd3a4c950587 100644
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/hisilicon/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/hisilicon/Makefile
@@ -12,3 +12,5 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_HIX5HD2) += \
 	hisi-x5hd2-dkb.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_SD5203) += \
 	sd5203.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_HI3716CV200) += \
+	hi3716cv200-ar513w.dtb
